      "content": "i get that it's a balance, but which one is the more realistic outcome? like, do the actual economic studies show that the inequality reduction happens, or is the capital flight/investment drop-off basically a guaranteed consequence? i'm trying to see if one side is just more grounded in reality than the other.",
